        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">remote communities, remote community, remote population, remote populations, subsistance farmers, remote areas, remote household, remote households, rural poverty, impoverished agricultural, impoverished rural, poor agricultural, poor farmers, poor farms, poor rural, subsistance farming, subsistance farms, agricultural day labor, agricultural day laborer, agriculture day labor, agriculture day laborer, small farm, small farms, smallholder, smallholders, impoverished fishing, poor fishing, artisanal fisheries, artisanal fishery, artisanal fishing, marginalized farmer, marginalized farmers, forest user group, forest user groups, dependent on farming, field level stakeholder, field level stakeholders, from remote locations, in remote locations</skos:altLabel>
