inated, unsustainable subsidies are ended, unsustainable subsidies are removed, unsustainable subsidies phase-out, unsustainable subsidies should be eliminated, unsustainable subsidies will be eliminated, unsustainable subsidies will be removed, unsustainable subsidy are eliminated, unsustainable subsidy are ended, unsustainable subsidy are removed, unsustainable subsidy phase-out, unsustainable subsidy should be eliminated, unsustainable subsidy will be eliminated, unsustainable subsidy will be removed</skos:altLabel>
        <cpr:P7 xml:lang="en">Environmentally harmful subsidies can be (un)intentionally encourage unsustainable production, the depletion of natural resources or lead to the degradation of ecosystem health. Removing or reforming such subsidies discourages unsustainable practices, promotes greener alternatives, and better aligns economic incentives with environmental goals.</cpr:P7>
