ies for steel workers, opportunities for those working in extractive industries, opportunities for those working in the automotive industry, opportunities for those working in the fossil fuel, opportunities for workers extractive industries, opportunities for workers in high-emitting industries, opportunities for workers in the automotive industry, opportunities for workers in the fossil fuel, protect affected workers, protect coal mine workers, protect coal miners, protect fossil fuel workers, protect miners, protect mining towns, protect most impacted workers, protect most-impacted workers, protect steel workers, protect those working in extractive industries, protect those working in the automotive industry, protect those working in the fossil fuel, protect workers extractive industries, protect workers in high-emitting industries, protect workers in the automotive industry, protect workers in the fossil fuel, protecting affected workers, protecting coal mine workers, protecting coal miners, protecting fossil fuel workers, protecting miners, protecting mining towns, protecting most impacted workers, protecting most-impacted workers, protecting steel workers, protecting those working in extractive industries, protecting those working in the automotive industry, protecting those working in the fossil fuel, protecting workers extractive industries, protecting workers in high-emitting industries, protecting workers in the automotive industry, protecting workers in the fossil fuel, support affected workers, support coal mine workers, support coal miners, support for affected workers, support for coal mine workers, support for coal miners, support for fossil fuel workers, support for miners, support for mining towns, support for most impacted workers, support for most-impacted workers, support for steel workers, support for those working in extractive industries, support for those working in the automotive industry, support for those working in the fossil fuel, support for workers extractive industries, support for workers in high-emitting industries, support for workers in the automotive industry, support for workers in the fossil fuel, support fossil fuel workers, support miners, support mining towns, support most impacted workers, support most-impacted workers, support steel workers, support those working in extractive industries, support those working in the automotive industry, support those working in the fossil fuel, support workers extractive industries, support workers in high-emitting industries, support workers in the automotive industry, support workers in the fossil fuel, supporting affected workers, supporting coal mine workers, supporting coal miners, supporting fossil fuel workers, supporting miners, supporting mining towns, supporting most impacted workers, supporting most-impacted workers, supporting steel workers, supporting those working in extractive industries, supporting those working in the automotive industry, supporting those working in the fossil fuel, supporting workers extractive industries, supporting workers in high-emitting industries, supporting workers in the automotive industry, supporting workers in the fossil fuel, supports affected workers, supports coal mine workers, supports coal miners, supports fossil fuel workers, supports miners, supports mining towns, supports most impacted workers, supports most-impacted workers, supports steel workers, supports those working in extractive industries, supports those working in the automotive industry, supports those working in the fossil fuel, supports workers extractive industries, supports workers in high-emitting industries, supports workers in the automotive industry, supports workers in the fossil fuel, transition for affected workers, transition for coal mine workers, transition for coal miners, transition for miners, transition for mining towns, transition for most impacted workers, transition for most-impacted workers, transition for steel workers, transition for those working in extractive industries, transition for those working in the automotive industry, transition for those working in the fossil fuel, transition for workers extractive industries, transition for workers in high-emitting industries, transition for workers in the automotive industry, transition for workers in the fossil fuel, employment for coal-dependent, employment for oil workers, former affected workers, former coal mine workers, former coal miners, former coal mining, former coal-dependent, former fossil fuel, former miners, former mining, former mining towns, former most impacted workers, former most-impacted workers, former oil workers, former steel workers, former those working in extractive industries, former those working in the automotive industry, former those working in the fossil fuel, former workers extractive industries, former workers in high-emitting industries, former workers in the automotive industry, former workers in the fossil fuel, help coal-dependent, help oil workers, jobs for coal-dependent, jobs for oil workers, opportunities for coal-dependent, opportunities for oil workers, protect coal-dependent, protect oil workers, protecting coal-dependent, protecting oil workers, support coal-dependent, support for coal-dependent, support for oil workers, support oil workers, supporting coal-dependent, supporting oil workers, supports coal-dependent, supports oil workers, transition for coal mining, transition for coal-dependent, transition for fossil fuel, transition for mining, transition for oil workers, transitioning affected workers, transitioning coal mine workers, transitioning coal miners, transitioning coal-dependent, transitioning fossil fuel workers, transitioning miners, transitioning mining towns, transitioning most impacted workers, transitioning most-impacted workers, transitioning oil workers, transitioning steel workers, transitioning those working in extractive industries, transitioning those working in the automotive industry, transitioning those working in the fossil fuel, transitioning workers extractive industries, transitioning workers in high-emitting industries, transitioning workers in the automotive industry, transitioning workers in the fossil fuel, reconversion of activities, reconversion of workers</skos:altLabel>
