limate resilient towns, climate resilient urban areas, climate resilient urban environments, climate resilient villages, climate-smart build environment, climate-smart cities, climate-smart city, climate-smart infrastructure, climate-smart neighbourhood, climate-smart neighbourhoods, climate-smart rural areas, climate-smart settlements, climate-smart towns, climate-smart urban areas, climate-smart urban environments, climate-smart villages, resilience of build environment, resilience of cities, resilience of city, resilience of infrastructure, resilience of neighbourhood, resilience of neighbourhoods, resilience of rural areas, resilience of settlements, resilience of towns, resilience of urban areas, resilience of urban environments, resilience of villages, resilient build environment, resilient city, resilient neighbourhood, resilient neighbourhoods, resilient rural areas, resilient urban areas, resilient urban environments, climate-proofed infrastructure, climate-responsive built, resilience of urban infrastructure, infrastructure-based climate adaptation, climate-resilient homestead, climate-resilient homesteads</skos:altLabel>
