        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://climatepolicyradar.wikibase.cloud/entity/Q557"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">cultural and natural heritage resilience</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">resilient cultural heritage, resilient natural heritage, adaptation of cultural heritage, adaptation of heritage, adaptation of natural heritage, adaptation of social heritage, adaptation of societal heritage, adaptations of cultural heritage, adaptations of heritage, adaptations of natural heritage, adaptations of social heritage, adapting cultural heritage, adapting heritage, adapting natural heritage, adapting social heritage, adaptive capacity of cultural heritage, adaptive capacity of heritage, adaptive capacity of natural heritage, adaptive capacity of social heritage, climate resilient cultural heritage, climate resilient heritage, climate resilient natural heritage, climate resilient social heritage, climate-smart cultural heritage, climate-smart heritage, climate-smart natural heritage, climate-smart social heritage, climate-smart societal heritage, resilience of cultural heritage, resilience of heritage, resilience of natural heritage, resilience of social heritage, resilience of societal heritage, resilient heritage, resilient social heritage, resilient societal heritage, protect cultural heritage, protect intangible cultural heritage, protect natural heritage</skos:altLabel>
        <cpr:P20 xml:lang="en">etrke5xm</cpr:P20>
        <cpr:P7 xml:lang="en">Action or measure that increases resilience of societal, cultural and natural heritage to climate change. Climate change and associated heavy precipitation and flooding present serious risks to cultural and natural heritage, including valuable museums, archival collections and areas of valuable natural significance. Increasing resilience of cultural and natural heritage to climate change requires proactive climate adaptation which can reduce deterioration and potential loss while maximising heritage benefits for current and future generations.</cpr:P7>
        <schema:description xml:lang="en">Action or measure that increases resilience of societal, cultural and natural heritage to climate change impacts.</schema:description>
    </owl:Class>
    


