        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">resilient fisheries, fisheries management, resilient fishing, adaptation of fisheries, adaptation of fishing, fisheries co-management, adaptation of fish, adaptation of fishery, adaptation of fishfarming, adaptation of fishfarms, adaptation of seafood, adaptations of fish, adaptations of fisheries, adaptations of fishery, adaptations of fishfarming, adaptations of fishfarms, adaptations of fishing, adaptations of seafood, adapting fish, adapting fisheries, adapting fishery, adapting fishfarming, adapting fishfarms, adapting fishing, adapting seafood, adaptive capacity of fish, adaptive capacity of fisheries, adaptive capacity of fishery, adaptive capacity of fishfarming, adaptive capacity of fishfarms, adaptive capacity of fishing, adaptive capacity of seafood, climate resilient fish, climate resilient fisheries, climate resilient fishery, climate resilient fishfarming, climate resilient fishfarms, climate resilient fishing, climate resilient seafood, climate-smart fish, climate-smart fisheries, climate-smart fishery, climate-smart fishfarming, climate-smart fishfarms, climate-smart fishing, climate-smart seafood, resilience of fish, resilience of fisheries, resilience of fishery, resilience of fishfarming, resilience of fishfarms, resilience of fishing, resilience of seafood, resilient fish, resilient fishery, resilient fishfarming, resilient fishfarms, resilient seafood, resilience in the fisheries</skos:altLabel>
        <schema:description xml:lang="en">Strengthening the resilience of the fishing sector to climate change impacts.</schema:description>
    </owl:Class>
    


