        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">aquaculture adaptation</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">adaptive aquaculture, resilient aquaculture, adaptation of aquaculture, changing aquaculture practices, adaptations of aquaculture, adapting aquaculture, adaptive capacity of aquaculture, climate resilient aquaculture, climate-smart aquaculture, resilience of aquaculture</skos:altLabel>
