        <cpr:P7 xml:lang="en">Encompasses both capture fisheries and aquaculture, involving the harvesting of fish, crustaceans and other aquatic organisms. This sector provides essential sources of protein and supports coastal and rural livelihoods through controlled and wild harvesting activities.</cpr:P7>
